Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
