Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momoo! Lunchtime! Momoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.18,0:02:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Momoo\Nshow up late to a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The possession of weapons is a\Nclear affront to my authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an example to any other\Nwould-be rebels in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:03:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you right now so\Nthey can see the fate that awaits them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is insane. He killed someone for\Njust having a weapon. I won't land. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't go out there You have\Nabsolutely no right to do this, Arlong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've paid your tribute\Nwithout fail for over
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eight years Why would\Nwe rebel against it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it It makes no sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now take your hand off Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like he used the\Nweapons! That's right! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let Genzo go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoarding weapons shows he was\Nplanning a rebellion against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, on the other hand,\NI could destroy you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please try to protect your friends so\Nyou won't give me an excuse to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.94,0:03:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way is fine, but\Nrebellions will not be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to waste all of our\Nwork over the past eight years?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time for you to give your lives for\Nthis village was back when they first came.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we must continue to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most important thing is\Nthat we continue to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We swore we would not let them\Ndefeat us as long as we're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gensang! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Zed, I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, it's good to know that even disgusting\Ninsects like you enjoy being alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way any of you will ever come\Nclose to the perfection of the Fistman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants you to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just stand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your deaths will mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must continue to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good ending for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay close attention, humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:05:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what happens to those who defy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's inside their tiny heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone on the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the great warrior of\Nthe sea, Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also known as the Demon King Usopp,\Nfeared and hated by almost half the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I command thousands of\Nmen, loyal and vicious men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the guy I told you about, the\None with the long nose and got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring on your thousands of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush them one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exploding star did\Nnothing, and now he's pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repulsive human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can a creature like you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong, hold on just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After losing Koza, we can't afford\Nto kill off any more tribute,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,money!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Villages are fun to destroy, but\Nruling over them makes us more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.34,0:06:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we lose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some, we can always get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man must reign to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's destroying it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I dead yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not dead yet! Oh crap! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him and tear him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to Arlong Park\Nbefore he destroys everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does that jumpsunker think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can all live for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has all been my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a fish man, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but who was that guy who attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to be back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Nami. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never just come walking\Nthrough Cocoyashi anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard quite a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have to get seven\Nmillion more berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your already bad reputation\Njust keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong can be a very reasonable\Nguy when he wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a little more\Nmoney to finish our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just seven million berries\Nshy of the 100 million gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's really not that high a price
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considering it's gonna\Nbuy back our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She tells me to run but I've\Ngot nowhere else to go but
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here besides promised Luffy\NI'd bring her back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man what's he up to because things\Nare getting messy around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's mine. I put it on my\Nplate. That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, how about you\Neat this thing instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't feed that\Nrotten slop to my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh, quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.57,0:09:14.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,0)\an2\bord4.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,640)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)}Momoo the Sea Cow\NHeavy Combat Beast\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:09:09.57,0:09:14.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,640)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}Momoo the Sea Cow\NHeavy Combat Beast\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hippo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, you can tell\Nit's from the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it doing all the way\Nout here in the East Loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.74,0:09:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he staring at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants the food! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clint, give it to him before\Nhe sinks the ship! Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad sea cow, stay away from our food! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you knocked it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, you made it mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:09:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's back for more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumbass, there's no reason to\Npunch this poor, hungry hippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's probably just a baby and can't\Ncatch food for herself yet huh that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here you go, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i won't hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was gonna eat me with the plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what could i do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is my show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are insane. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five more minutes of this, and\NI'll keel over from boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of super fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even the mighty Hachan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong of the Arlong Pirates\Ncan pull you from the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an epic battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but you're\Nthe gutsiest fish in the East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are indeed the gutsiest\Nfish in the East Blue, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, that's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak up now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm Hatchan, but all my friends\Ncall me Hachi! Are you a fishman, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, of course, I'm\Nan amazing octopus fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like you're just a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. A marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or possibly a guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong isn't here, is he? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there's some long-nosed\Nguy running around causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.94,0:12:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Arlong locked up the\Nlong-nosed friend here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then went to Cocoyashi Village to\Nhunt down that pesky troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man. Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I better save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I get there? Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a guest. Hop in.\NI'll take you. Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't shake these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those in favor of\Nleaving Usopp alone say aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye! Aye! Aye! Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool, you're dumber than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you agree with me too! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eggstar, special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I'm gonna roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess fishmen aren't all\Nthey're cracked up to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one of those scaly morons\Ncan catch Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey! Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine! Thanks for asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it down safe and\Nsound, as you can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong should be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot to ask you your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been over this. I told you my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hachan! Nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saru. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he come to collect my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man we got, that was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was Zoro. That's him? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swordsman was Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah Long, found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that Zoro's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:16:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catching this scum isn't\Nenough to satisfy my hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'm sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just saying hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how we do it in my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Longnose, you are one of Zoro's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for well-known\Nbounty hunters to come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me. I don't have\Nanything to do with Zoro. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please don't kill me Shoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough of your cowardly lies\NEven if you don't know Zoro,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still stood against\NArlong. You die either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, no more lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro and I are like\Nbrothers, partners for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you so much as lay one of\Nyour creepy webbed fingers on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll show up and kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I kill you, Zoro will show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, that's not what\NI was trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.32,0:17:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to say the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing me is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep me alive,\NZoro will show up, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is how how did he
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escape what do you mean what I mean is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone let him escape\NI think that somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has betrayed us perhaps it was Nami who
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let him in so that bastard could take\Nyour head now that you mention it she has
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been acting strange lately yeah she Even\Nhelped Zoro when you jumped into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me she was one who had Zoro\Nfrom this dive and tricked us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, her chief\Nskill is deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is pure conjecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swore I was a member of\Nthis group eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My loyalty is shown with this tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's natural for you to be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't suspect you of\Nanything treacherous, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we've known\Neach other for eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just a little on\Nedge, right now, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you can understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to focus on Zoro and\Nhis gang of bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just had to go and do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Longnose here, not\Neven you can save him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No not when he defied our long how long\Nhow long will I be suspected of betrayal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too clever for your own\Ngood. I'll have the amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our long and I Agreed too\Nsoon it doesn't make any sense
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for me to betray you now\NI know eight years ago you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,agreed to purchase Cocoyashi\Nvillage for a hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and berries, but I just\Ncan't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love nothing except money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You betrayed your family\Nand your village for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, why do you care for this village now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This puny little heap of houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard about it,\Nbut I found this in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be—that's my what? What do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean you're saying he was captured yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they took him back to Arlong Park just\Na little while ago that courageous young
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man stood up to Arlong and those
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fishmen he's probably dead by now this is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad. They won't be forgiving. He got\Ncaught right after my little visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's up? Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster to Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watch the sun rise,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I begin to wonder What could be\Nthe reason it's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get them to come back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.88,0:21:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they're everything I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.94,0:21:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass these arms around my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make the way?

